  "description": "Provides high-performance PostgreSQL support for TuanZi's Entity Framework Core with:\n\t\t\t- Full PostgreSQL EF Core provider integration\n\t\t\t- PostgreSQL-specific data type handling (JSONB, UUID, arrays, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Advanced connection pooling and resiliency\n\t\t\t- Native support for PostgreSQL extensions\n\t\t\t- Optimized query translation for PostgreSQL\n\t\t\t- Full migration and schema management\n\t\t\t- Compatibility with PostgreSQL 10+ versions\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi repository pattern",
